@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@tokenUrl = http://localhost:8081/realms/autoservice/protocol/openid-connect/token

### Токен адміністратора
POST {{tokenUrl}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=autoservice-api&username=manager&password=manager123

> {% client.global.set("lab4AdminToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Створити послугу з ціною 100.01 — 201 (звичайний режим)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services
Authorization: Bearer {{lab4AdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Діагностика","description":"Огляд авто","price":100.01,"durationMinutes":30}

> {% client.global.set("lab4Id", response.body.id); %}

### Через проксі — 200, total 190.02
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{lab4AdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{{lab4Id}}, {{lab4Id}}]

